        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jim Liberman, Russell James Liberman, Lew Arrington\n- Products: Brutus\n- Topics: Funny cars, drag racing\n\nFacts:\n- Russell James Liberman was born on September 12, 1945, and he was a United States drag racer from Pennsylvania.\n- Russell James Liberman was known as \"Jungle Jim.\"\n- In the middle 1960s, Brutus was a pioneering funny car driven by Jim Liberman.\n- In the middle 1960s, Lew Arrington prepared Brutus as crew chief.\n- Russell James Liberman died on September 9, 1977.",
